# The words every expectation and story in this suite is written in. It models the sim's
# hand launch (src/sim.rs auto_launch, src/input.rs) closely enough to show the system
# working end to end; world.rs is the toy system it runs against.

Vocabulary:
  State: the aircraft is in hand | launching | flying | crashed
  State: the throttle is 0..100 %
  State: the flight mode is MANUAL | ANGLE | ACRO
  State: the calibration wizard is open | closed
  Event: the pilot presses launch
  Event: the pilot presses reset
  Event: the pilot presses flight mode
  Event: the pilot presses calibrate
  Event: the aircraft hits the ground

Background:
  Given the aircraft is in hand
  And the throttle is 0 %
  And the flight mode is MANUAL
  And the calibration wizard is closed
